      <title>GitHub HydraFusion 如何拆分子任务路由多模型，匹配Opus 5性能却大幅降本</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260904/GitHub-HydraFusion-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%8B%86%E5%88%86%E5%AD%90%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%8C%B9%E9%85%8DOpus-5%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E5%8D%B4%E5%A4%A7%E5%B9%85%E9%99%8D%E6%9C%AC/</link>
